# Octet   : a U32 whose value is < 256 (Bend has no U8). Behaviour on inputs
#           >= 256 is unspecified (table lookups fall to a default).
# Symbol  : `Vec`, a balanced tree of U32 "words", each word packing 4 octets
#           (octet 4k+j of the symbol sits at bits 24-8j..31-8j: big-endian
#           inside a word, so word k's top byte is octet 4k). RFC symbol sizes
#           T are multiples of Al=4, so no padding is ever needed. See
#           docs/gf256.md for the rationale.
#
# Irreducible polynomial: x^8 + x^4 + x^3 + x^2 + 1 (0x11D); alpha = 2.
